# UP6b ("Only its own"): of three that dropped, two resume and one never does. The others' resumes
# never withdraw the departed device's Remove: it is committed and its leaf is gone within the
# normal sweep window.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
group call kind=call target=edededededededededededededededed community=none creator=alice
join bob call via=external
sync alice
join carol call via=external
sync alice
sync bob
absent alice call
absent bob call
absent carol call
resume alice call withdrawn=1
resume bob call withdrawn=1
sync alice
sync bob
commit alice call
sync bob
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT send carol call am I still in the call
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT resume carol call
send alice call carol is gone
expect_decrypts bob call carol is gone
